"claritate=0..100&amp;...&amp;pornit=0|1[&amp;incearca=1|&amp;renunta=1]</"
"code>: saglabā profila iestatījumus (skaitļi, kas dalās ar 5); ar "
"<code>incearca=1</code> tie ir redzami uzreiz bez saglabāšanas, "
"<code>renunta=1</code> atjauno saglabāto; <code>POST /api/calitate-imagine-"
"implicite?profil=&lt;profil&gt;|toate</code>; <code>POST /api/calitate-"
"imagine-hdr?iesire=auto|hdr10|hlg|none</code> (kanāls tiek palaists no "
"jauna, jautājums parādās televizorā); <code>POST /api/calitate-imagine-"
"comparatie?reglaj=&lt;cheie&gt;&amp;pornit=0|1</code> (pus ekrāna, 60 s)"

msgid ""
"<code>POST /api/canale-porneste?fila=&amp;buchet=&amp;ref=</code>: pornește "
"canalul prin lista de pe televizor"
msgstr ""
"<code>POST /api/canale-porneste?fila=&amp;buchet=&amp;ref=</code>: palaiž "
"kanālu caur televizora sarakstu"

msgid ""
"<code>POST /api/cauta-setari-televizor?cheie=&lt;cheie&gt;</code>: deschide "
"pe televizor un rezultat al căutării, cu rândul găsit ales"
